10 REM MUSIC AND CIRCLES: A KEYBOARD DRIVEN TOUR OF SOUND AND GRAPHICS
20 REM 1-4 PLAYS ONE PHRASE, Z PLAYS ALL FOUR, 0 ENDS THE DEMO
30 REM SHOWS PLAY (3 CHANNELS, T/M/Y/V/O/R), ASYNC PLAYBACK, CLICK, BEEP,
40 REM AND THE FMRUBY EXTENSIONS CIRCLE / PRESENT ON THE TEXT PLANE
50 REM PHRASES ARE UNDER 31 CHARS, WHICH IS THE STRING LIMIT
60 CLICK ON
70 GOSUB 500
100 REM MENU LOOP. NON BLOCKING INKEY$ WITH A PAUSE, SO THE SCREEN
105 REM KEEPS BEING PRESENTED WHILE THE DEMO WAITS FOR A KEY
106 PAUSE 1
107 A$=INKEY$
110 IF A$="" THEN 106
120 IF A$="0" THEN 900
130 IF A$="Z" THEN GOSUB 300:GOTO 106
140 P=VAL(A$)
150 IF P<1 THEN 106
160 IF P>4 THEN 106
170 GOSUB 200
180 GOTO 106
200 REM PLAY PHRASE P, THEN BLOOM CIRCLES WHILE IT IS STILL SOUNDING
210 RESTORE
220 FOR I=1 TO P:READ A$:NEXT
230 PLAY A$
240 GOSUB 600
250 RETURN
300 REM ALL FOUR PHRASES BACK TO BACK
310 RESTORE
320 FOR P=1 TO 4
330 READ A$:PLAY A$
340 GOSUB 600
350 NEXT
360 BEEP
370 RETURN
400 DATA "T4M1Y2V12O3C5E5G5:C5E5G5:O1C9"
410 DATA "T4O4C5O3B5A5:E5D5C5:O1G9"
420 DATA "T4F5A5O4C5:O3A5B5O4C5:O1F9"
430 DATA "T4M0V15O4C7R3C3:E7R3E3:O1C9"
500 REM MENU. CLS ALSO WIPES THE CIRCLES, WHICH SHARE THE TEXT PLANE
510 CLS
520 LOCATE 8,3:PRINT "オンガク デモ"
530 LOCATE 4,7:PRINT "1-4  キョク ヲ エラブ"
540 LOCATE 4,9:PRINT "Z    ゼンブ キク"
550 LOCATE 4,11:PRINT "0    オワリ"
560 RETURN
600 REM CIRCLES BLOOM UNDER THE MENU WHILE THE PHRASE PLAYS. PLAY IS
610 REM ASYNCHRONOUS, SO THE DRAWING AND THE SOUND RUN TOGETHER
620 FOR K=1 TO 14
630 X=RND(200)+12:Y=RND(50)+120:R=RND(12)+4:C=RND(200)+40
640 IF K MOD 2=0 THEN CIRCLE X,Y,R,C,1
650 IF K MOD 2=1 THEN CIRCLE X,Y,R,C
660 PRESENT
670 PAUSE 6
680 NEXT
690 GOSUB 500
695 PRESENT
699 RETURN
900 CLS
910 LOCATE 10,11:PRINT "オワリ"
915 PAUSE 120
920 END
